    <string name="security_explanation">Locked notes close again whenever you leave the app. In backups they are encrypted with your PIN, so restoring a backup asks for the PIN it was made with. Your fingerprint is never stored by Müsvedde. If you forget the PIN, locked notes cannot be recovered; a longer PIN makes backups harder to crack.</string>
